                                "text": "We suffer equal pain from the pertinacious adhesion of unwelcome images, as from the evanescence of those which are pleasing and useful"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e9131414-1f69-31ee-984f-fb6e03daff7e",
